"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 41 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025, February to March ran 3% of normal and June to July ran 143% on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, and grid 14514 got just 26% of normal that year.</p>"}
